'''Red Hallow''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] knife that was awarded to the players who finished within the Top 100 on the leaderboard during the [[Halloween Event 2018|2018 Halloween Event]].

== Appearance ==
Its blade is white in the shape of a cutlass with spiky red pumpkin vines going along the spine. The guard is made out of a red pumpkin with four red horns and a demonic face imprinted on it in black. Black pumpkin vines with red tints protrude out from behind the pumpkin. The handle is red with the bottom of it being curled.

== Trivia ==
*During the event, players could collect & buy as many [[Candies (2018)|Candies]] (acted exactly like [[coins]] pre-Season 1 but Halloween-exclusive) to increase their score, which determined their rank on the leaderboard.
*Other variants of this include [[Bronze Hallow]], [[Silver Hallow]], and [[Gold Hallow|Gold Hallow.]]
*This item is a reskin of [[Hallow's Blade]]/[[Hallow's Edge]], two [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knives.
**The mesh and texture for [[Hallow's Blade]]/[[Hallow's Edge]] and the variants of it all derive from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/181356054/All-Hallows-Sword All Hallow's Sword], but with an altered color scheme.
*This item is [[Trading|untradable]].

